# Enterprise Edition

Chatwoot has an Enterprise overlay under `enterprise/` that extends/overrides OSS code.

## Before Editing

Search both trees: `rg -n "FooService|ControllerName|ModelName" app enterprise`

## Checklist

- Enterprise-only behavior → add module via `prepend_mod_with` / `include_mod_with`, not direct OSS edits
- Enterprise-exclusive features → place code under `enterprise/`
- New endpoints/services/models → check if Enterprise needs override or extension point
- Avoid hardcoding plan-specific behavior in OSS; use config, feature flags, or extension points
- Keep request/response contracts stable across OSS and Enterprise
- Mirror renames/moves in `enterprise/` to prevent drift
- Enterprise specs → `spec/enterprise/` mirroring OSS layout

